      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "IAS Special Year on Univalent Foundations",
      "source_hash": 11268848646843318388,
      "context_hash": 5335111980500288684,
      "translation": "IAS 유니밸런트 기초 특별 연구년",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "univalent": "유니밸런트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T07:09:18.688377Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "A Special Year on Univalent Foundations of Mathematics was held in 2012-13 at the Institute for Advanced Study, School of Mathematics, organized by Steve Awodey, Thierry Coquand, and Vladimir Voevodsky. The following people were the official participants.",
      "source_hash": 9627820469124461312,
      "context_hash": 15668253736770167402,
      "translation": "수학의 유니밸런트 기초에 관한 특별 연구년 프로그램이 Steve Awodey, Thierry Coquand, Vladimir Voevodsky의 주관으로 2012-13년에 고등연구소(IAS) 수학부에서 개최되었습니다. 다음은 공식 참가자 명단입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "univalent": "유니밸런트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T07:09:18.688377Z",
      "issues": []
    },
